        "title": "Se Micro",
        "slug": "se-micro",
        "url": "https://contemporarytype.com/fonts/se-micro",
        "body": "Se Micro is the microtypographic counterpart to its sibling, [Se Macro](https://contemporarytype.com/fonts/se-macro) – refined for clarity at small sizes. Both blend functional versatility for use in flexible design systems with architectural precision and understated elegance. While Se Micro follows the same skeleton as Se Macro, its differences become more pronounced in the heavier weights. Se Micro’s open apertures and deep inktraps are optimized for performance in challenging conditions. When used at display sizes, these features shift from purely functional to aesthetically distinctive, giving it a strong and idiosyncratic character.\r\n\r\nDesigned for the visual language of contemporary brands, fashion labels, cultural platforms, and design-driven products, Se Micro offers more than function – it offers identity. It’s a tool for designers who demand both structural integrity and stylistic impact. Spanning an impressive 10 weights and 3 widths, Se Micro is part of Gallery Type’s Se Collection, launched with Se Macro and to be joined by Se Mono and Se Rounded – to be released between 2026 and 2027.\r\n\r\nRelated typeface: [Se Macro](https://contemporarytype.com/fonts/se-macro)",
